    "body": "## Chat 03B1 repair of independent blockers (current HEAD `67bb433731cb3ed8f5f78f9b0e4f2056a6aa5d99`)\n\nFollow-up to [blocking review](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/pull/440#issuecomment-6228212806) on old HEAD `427f0aacad3ed478be81c48ec145d0c01c677cd4`.\n\n1. **Receipt/outbox identity:** SQL preflight now validates receipt array IDs as unique nonempty strings, rejects duplicate outbox IDs, and enforces equal event counts plus exact reverse membership. `receipt=[\"e1\",\"e1\"] / events=[e1,e2]`, `receipt=[e1,e2] / events=[e1,e1]`, missing/invalid IDs all abort as `INVALID_TRANSITION`, not partially written.\n2. **Event version:** every emitted event must carry JSON integer `version === expected_version+1`. Arbitrary `999`, null, string, float, stale version all fail before any SQL write. Required event shape (`eventId`, `type`, `payload`) is also checked.\n\n**Regression evidence:** four new test methods (total 16); assertions compare pre/post battle snapshot, all receipts, all outbox rows and explicitly commit after rejected statements to prove no partial changes. Existing two-connection CAS race remains tested. One interim push run exposed a missing explicit duplicate-outbox check, fixed in final commit `67bb433...`; exact-head PR [Gameplay CAS run 38994902546](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/38994902546) = completed/success (**16/16** real SQLite tests); exact-head [ai-forensics 38994902896](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/38994902896) = completed/success.\n\n**Scope:** only pre-existing PR-owned SQL migration and SQLite test file updated since review. PR remains **OPEN / DRAFT / UNMERGED**; `main` unchanged at `57244500e58d1ee6f0b7f2f5e87cd2e63bb83dcb`. No telemetry, browser runtime, Stage 7.15, UI, auth, Worker, provisioning, or economy changes.\n\n**Status:** `BLOCKERS_REPAIRED / SQLITE_CI_PASS / AWAIT_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW`. Real Cloudflare D1 trigger+concurrency compatibility, privacy/identity/retention policy, and secure PvP are still **not proven**. Do not merge or declare Chat 03 complete.",
